flowchart TB
  PI[Project Input] --> CS[CANONICAL_STATE]
  CS --> AC[Acceptance Contract]
  AC --> DAG[Stage-Phase-Task DAG]
  DAG --> TM[Traceability Matrix]
  TM --> Tests[Tests + Oracles]
  Tests --> Evidence[Raw Evidence]
  Evidence --> Manifest[MANIFEST + SHA256]
  Manifest --> Subject[CandidateIdentity / SubjectIdentity]
  Subject --> VH[Verifier Handoff]
  V3[v3 Source Snapshots] --> Inherit[Semantic Inheritance]
  Inherit --> CS
  Catalog[Skill Catalog Snapshot] --> PassA[Pass A]
  PassA --> PassB[Pass B]
  PassB --> PassC[Pass C]
  PassC --> Evidence
  Corpus[8192 Regression Cases] --> Tests
